Box 51448, conv 49204: the helper's question was clean (the fact check
holds a quality word back from it), and the owner's own confirmation line
still read „სანდო ნოტარიუსს". After a run whose question went, a quality
word (სანდო, საიმედო, reliable, надёжный …) the owner never wrote in this
conversation is taken out of the reply, by the test the question already
passes. The owner's typed lines are read only when such a word is there;
the read is shared with the discussion check.

